////////////////AUDIO//////////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_pippin139
"I wonder if a Took has ever walked these paths before..."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_sam183
"What a pretty thing."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_pippin153
"It reminds me of Rivendell."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_pippin154
"It's so quiet."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_merry053
"It's like we're the only ones left in the world."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_merry054
"How old is this place?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_merry055
"Listen, I can hear the birds."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_sam194
"I never thought I'd see the sea Mr Frodo."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_sam195
"Look at those flowers, they're still blooming even though there's no one to see them."
END



/////////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_merry035
"Have they all left?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_sam173
"It appears their time has ended..."
END


